    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Andrew Deftereoes of Leonard Wilson Keenan is delighted to present 5 Barnwell Lane, to the market. This  fabulous home has been loved and improved to a high standard by its proud current owner who has created a stylish and well-designed haven. Its excellent location adds to its appeal. A stunning family home it is the perfect property to upgrade to or for those requiring an exceptional property that requires nothing doing to it.  \r\n\r\nOn entering the ground floor of the property, you are greeted by a well-proportioned, bright hallway leading off of which is a spacious and bright living room. Large south facing windows flood the living area with light while tall ceilings enhance the sense of space, creating a warm and welcoming space in which you can relax, unwind, and escape to after a long day. Further on off the hallway is a simply superb spacious designer kitchen and open plan dining room, this fabulous space benefits from the extension with Velux windows and a separate laundry area. The stunning kitchen has an abundance of base and eye level storage which is perfect for entertaining. Direct access through double glass doors to the large lovely garden completes this ground floor.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor you have 3 bright and spacious bedrooms and the main bedroom is en suite. All rooms are a good size and provide plenty of room for storage in the fitted wardrobes. A fully tiled family bathroom completes this level.\r\n\r\nThe attic has been converted into an excellent space with storage that has endless options as an office or additional bedroom or lounge. The extra-large Velux skylights flood this conversion with light.\r\n\r\nThis is truly a home that has to be seen to be appreciated. Early viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nFeatures:-\r\n\r\n•       Attic conversion\r\n\r\n•       Extension\r\n\r\n•       Upgraded kitchen and bathrooms\r\n\r\n•       Turnkey home of a very high standard\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThe location is superb, benefiting from very close proximity to Hansfield Station, Ongar Village and has excellent bus links. Great amenities like SuperValu Shopping Centre, Primary and secondary schools and also benefits from easy access to Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, the M50, and Dublin City Centre.  \r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
      {
